# Husk — environment variable template.
#
# Copy to .env (untracked; `.env` is gitignored) and fill in real values.
# NEVER commit a real key. test/src/screening.ts reads DILISENSE_API_KEY from
# the process environment first, then falls back to an untracked .env at the
# repo root or in test/.
#
# dilisense AML Screening API key (https://developers.dilisense.com).
# Used by the REAL screening witness (test/src/screening.ts) and the
# real-API integration test (test/src/test/pay-screening.test.ts).
# Free tier: 100 calls/month — the integration test spends at most 3.
DILISENSE_API_KEY=
